# `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads this directory to Cloud Build, and the
# Dockerfile only needs the Maven project (Dockerfile, pom.xml, mvnw, .mvn/,
# src/). Without this file every deploy uploaded ~450 MB, most of it tracked
# verification artifacts under output/.
#
# A .gcloudignore replaces gcloud's implicit use of .gitignore, so pull it back
# in: it keeps target/, local properties and service-account keys out.
#!include:.gitignore

.git
.github/
.claude/
.deploy-hosting/
output/
docs/
tests/
tools/
scripts/
mobile/
functions/
/*.md
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.html
/*.txt
/sieglings-dashboard-export.json
.DS_Store
